# The repo is worked on from Windows and from Unix, and CI runs shellcheck on
# run-bot.sh. A CRLF shebang line makes a script unrunnable in a way that is
# very hard to see, so line endings are pinned rather than left to core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
